SUMMARY:🔄 Gray Zone Warfare · Rogue Ops 0.5
DESCRIPTION:Game: Gray Zone Warfare\nType: Major Update\nStatus: Confirmed\
 n\nMajor content update and transition from pre-alpha to alpha\, with Hide
 out building\, crafting\, smuggling activities\, new locations and weapons
 . A soft wipe retains rank\, apparel\, vendor levels and completed tasks\,
  but resets lockers and money. Launch time has not been announced in this 
 source.\n\nLatest news:\nRogue Ops brings Hideout and crafting systems\, m
 ultiple playable characters\, and major gameplay improvements as the game 
 enters alpha. The update uses a soft wipe that retains progression but res
 ets lockers and money. Supporter Preview begins October 19\, followed by t
 he public update on October 22\, 2026.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://www.grayzo
 newarfare.com/news/player-driven-improvements-rogue-ops\n\nEvent source:\n
 https://www.grayzonewarfare.com/news/update-05-teaser
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
